sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant Main as main.go
    participant S as Strategy.Run
    participant X as Executor
    participant D as Deribit
    participant SM as StateManager

    Op->>Main: kill -USR1 pid  /  docker kill -s USR1 container
    Main->>S: KillSwitch() (idempotent)
    S->>S: leave the evaluate loop
    Note over S: detached context, 2 min budget — a SIGTERM cannot abort the flatten
    S->>X: CancelAllOrders(currency)
    X->>D: private/cancel_all_by_currency
    loop each pending entry
        S->>X: GetOrderState (what filled before the cancel)
        S->>SM: book the filled part
    end
    loop up to 3 passes while positions remain
        S->>X: GetPositions(currency)
        S->>SM: match the book to the exchange's shorts
        S->>X: buy MARKET each position (high priority)
        X->>D: private/buy
        D-->>X: filled_amount
        S->>SM: remove or reduce (partial fills retried)
    end
    S->>X: GetPositions — confirm the exchange is flat
    alt anything left open
        S->>S: log ERROR per position — close manually
    end
    S->>S: idle until stopped (exiting would let Docker restart into trading)
    Op->>Main: docker compose stop / SIGTERM
    S-->>Main: ErrKillSwitch
